th-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 19% of normal in January to February, then 225% in March to April. Grid 17818 had its driest year in 1970 at 42% of normal.</p>"}
